OL,3,GNEWSATimeline revealed for Blackpool's
OL,4,Anew court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA timescale has been revealed for plans
OL,7,Fto build a new multi-million pound
OL,8,Fmagistrates' court building in
OL,9,FBlackpool.
OL,11,FAt a meeting on Thursday, Blackpool
OL,12,FCouncil said work should commence on
OL,13,Fthe site in 2027 with the new
OL,14,Ffacilities open during 2029.
OL,16,FProgress had stalled when the original
OL,17,Fcontractor, ISG, went into
OL,18,Fadministration in 2024, but plans
OL,19,Fstarted moving forward again after the
OL,20,Fappointment of a replacement contractor
OL,21,Fin September.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
