OL,3,GNEWSATimeline revealed for Blackpool's
OL,4,Anew court
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new courthouse will be built at the
OL,7,Fjunction of Devonshire Road and Talbot
OL,8,FRoad, replacing facilities lost after
OL,9,Fthe closure of the Lancashire town's
OL,10,Fprevious court.
